# Architecture of {{PROJECT_NAME}}

This project is hexagonal. That is not configurable — see
`hexagonal-architecture` for the model, `separation-of-concerns` for placement
decisions. **This skill is only the local vocabulary: which file plays which
role, and where it goes.**

If anything here ever appears to contradict `hexagonal-architecture`, the hexagon
wins and this file is out of date — say so rather than following it.

