## Shared capability ports

Anything that reads the outside world — time, ids, delays, notifications,
opening a URL — is a port, injected like any other. Inner layers never reach
the global behind it. Their fakes are the ones tests use (`{{TESTING_SKILL}}`).

<!-- harness: SHARED_PORTS_TABLE — "| Need | Port | Production adapter | Test
