These are pre-existing and are **not** a licence to add more. New code follows
the hexagon, never the deviating code next to it. `enforce-now` means any code
you write or change in those paths complies immediately; `migrate` means the
deviation is fixed when its file is touched, in scope, or reported to the
orchestrator — never silently extended.
